msgid ""
"Extract 'archive' to 'folder'. Quit when finished.\n"
"'folder' will be created if it does not exist."
msgstr ""
"ស្រង់​ចេញ 'ប័ណ្ណសារ' ទៅ'ថត' ។ ចេញ​នៅ​ពេល​ចប់ ។\n"
